          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Verdant Burst"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(healing)\n\nWhen a leaf leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from its body, restoring 1d4 Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30-foot emanation. This area is filled with tree saplings, becoming 3. If the terrain is not a viable environment for these trees, they wither after 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "4a2dc6ef-aae8-4484-8dad-dac3ac68a31a",
